        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>The Placebo Effect: Are Expensive Placebos More Effective Than Cheap Placebos?</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\", \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 816px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n  .header {\n    background: #6b5fa8;\n    padding: 24px 40px 30px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .header h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Generic band ---------- */\n  .band {\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .band-inner {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .shelf {\n    height: 30px;\n  }\n\n  /* Purpose band (teal) */\n  .band-purpose {\n    background: #4cb8ce;\n    margin: 0 45px 0 55px;\n    padding: 18px 30px 20px 0;\n  }\n  .shelf-teal {\n    background: #63c6d8;\n    margin: 0 35px 0 40px;\n    height: 30px;\n  }\n\n  /* Hypothesis band (purple) */\n  .band-hypothesis {\n    background: #7b6fb5;\n    margin: 22px 45px 0 45px;\n    padding: 20px 30px 20px 0;\n  }\n  .shelf-purple {\n    background: #8579c4;\n    margin: 0 35px 0 40px;\n    height: 30px;\n  }\n\n  /* Method / Results band (teal) */\n  .band-method {\n    background: #4cb8ce;\n    margin: 18px 45px 0 45px;\n    padding: 26px 40px 30px 40px;\n  }\n  .shelf-teal-bottom {\n    background: #63c6d8;\n    margin: 0 35px 0 40px;\n    height: 32px;\n  }\n\n  h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n  }\n  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n  .txt-purpose { flex: 0 0 330px; padding-top: 22px; }\n  .txt-hypothesis { flex: 0 0 330px; padding-top: 30px; }\n\n  .art { flex: 0 0 auto; }\n\n  /* Two column area */\n  .two-col {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 40px;\n  }\n  .col { flex: 1 1 0; }\n\n  /* ---------- Placeholders ---------- */\n  .placeholder {\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);\n    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.75);\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 4px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .ph-purpose { width: 265px; height: 175px; margin: 10px 0 0 45px; }\n  .ph-hypothesis { width: 255px; height: 170px; margin: 20px 0 0 55px; }\n  .ph-results { width: 210px; height: 130px; margin: 20px 0 0 55px; }\n\n  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */\n  .footer {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    padding: 20px 45px 24px 45px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #4a3f7a;\n  }\n  .logo {\n    flex: 0 0 150px;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #6b5fa8;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n    padding-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .refs {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: #7b6fb5;\n  }\n  .refs .study {\n    color: #4a3f7a;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 3px;\n  }\n  .refs .label { font-weight: bold; color: #4a3f7a; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <h1>The Placebo Effect: Are Expensive Placebos<br>More Effective Than Cheap Placebos?</h1>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- PURPOSE -->\n  <div class=\"band band-purpose\">\n    <div class=\"band-inner\">\n      <div class=\"art\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder ph-purpose\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 45px;\">\n          [Illustration: price tag with dollar sign, pill bottles and prescription pad — left side]\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"txt-purpose\">\n        <h2>Purpose</h2>\n        <p>In what ways can fictitious costs impact the effectiveness of a placebo? To better understand how the ‘placebo effect’ takes place, we will provide placebos of different reported costs and measure their impact on the patients.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"shelf shelf-teal\"></div>\n\n  <!-- HYPOTHESIS -->\n  <div class=\"band band-hypothesis\">\n    <div class=\"band-inner\">\n      <div class=\"art\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder ph-hypothesis\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 55px;\">\n          [Illustration: capsule pill, stack of gold coins and banknote — left side]\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"txt-hypothesis\">\n        <h2>Hypothesis</h2>\n        <p>Providing placebos that are ‘expensive’ will amplify the placebo effect of actual placebos with participants.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"shelf shelf-purple\"></div>\n\n  <!-- METHOD / RESULTS -->\n  <div class=\"band band-method\">\n    <div class=\"two-col\">\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <h2>Method</h2>\n        <p>Participants suffering from Parkinson’s Disease serve as placebo effect test subjects.</p>\n        <p>Each participant receives an effective drug valued at $100 per dose and then motor function changes are measured. After each participant receives an effective drug said to be valued at $1500 per dose, then their motor functions are measured again.</p>\n        <p>A comparison between motor function improvements following the administration of each placebo will help determine whether fictitious costs can influence the effectiveness of a placebo.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <h2>Results</h2>\n        <p>The study found motor functions improve significantly more for participants following the administration of a reportedly $1500 placebo, compared to a reportedly $100 placebo.</p>\n        <p>While the degree of improvement in motor function for participants varied due to the administration of a $1500 placebo drug, all participants experienced improved motor functions. A higher cost for a placebo will improve patients’ conditions even more.</p>\n        <figure class=\"placeholder ph-results\">\n          [Illustration: red first-aid kit and green medical clipboard — bottom right]\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"shelf shelf-teal-bottom\"></div>\n\n  <!-- FOOTER -->\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"logo\">M.I.S.H.B</div>\n    <div class=\"refs\">\n      <div class=\"study\">Study by Janelle Mauricio, Vanessa Garby, Shivinder Singh - The Massy Institute for Studies of Human Behavior</div>\n      <div><span class=\"label\">References:</span> Kemputo, Odelle., “The psychology of self-deception” The Anaptic Journal, 2017 // Satuda, Evan., Temitope, Andrew., “Neuroscience of Decision-Making” The Science Review, 2018 // Brahms, Hansen., Leigh, Anderson., “The Need and Neurology for Happiness”, The Arch Journal, 2020</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
